WEBVTT

00:15:26.426 --> 00:15:30.820
It took 20 years to design this
and get it implemented in the field.

00:15:30.844 --> 00:15:32.602
I was 12 years old.

00:15:33.768 --> 00:15:35.276
There's a problem here.

00:15:36.728 --> 00:15:38.085
Luckily, we're not alone.

00:15:38.712 --> 00:15:41.576
There are hundreds and hundreds
and hundreds and hundreds

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:45.576
and hundreds of architects
and designers and inventors

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:49.060
around the world that are getting
involved in humanitarian work.

00:15:51.234 --> 00:15:54.274
More hemp houses -- it's a theme
in Japan, apparently.

00:15:54.298 --> 00:15:55.933
I'm not sure what they're smoking.

00:15:55.957 --> 00:15:57.567
(Laughter)

00:15:59.671 --> 00:16:02.378
This is a Grip Clip,
designed by somebody who said,